Rule 3 (tensor dimensions must be compatible)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0) ∧ shape(v_1, 1) = shape(v_2, 1) ∧ shape(v_1, 2) = shape(v_2, 2) ∧ shape(v_1, 3) = shape(v_2, 3)
>>
Rule 4 (tensor size must match)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
>>
Rule 5 (tensor size must match at non-singleton dimension)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≠ 0 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≠ 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
